{"id":"3356f7f8d1c48a51","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-low-set-subuniform.md","title":"低度也可子统一列出全部可计算集合","display":"ex-low-set-subuniform — 低度也可子统一列出全部可计算集合","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-low-set-subuniform","aliases":["20-ex-low-set-subuniform"],"display":"ex-low-set-subuniform — 低度也可子统一列出全部可计算集合","chapter":"4","section":"4.9.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 4.9.6","source_printed_pages":[103],"source_pdf_pages":[139],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-low-basis]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-low-set-subuniform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-low-set-subuniform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-low-set-subuniform — 低度也可子统一列出全部可计算集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.9.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 4.9.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>103</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\{f\\in2^{\\omega^2}:\\forall e,x,y\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(x,e)=\\min(1,y)]\\}\">\\(P=\\{f\\in2^{\\omega^2}:\\forall e,x,y\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(x,e)=\\min(1,y)]\\}\\)</span>；矩阵按配对编码成 Cantor 点。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04a511cfa9ffa494\" href=\"?note=04a511cfa9ffa494\" title=\"20-thm-low-basis\">20-thm-low-basis</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}low-set-subuniform}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in P\\ [f\\prime\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land\\{\\chi_B:B\\in\\mathcal R\\}\\subseteq\\{f_e:e\\in\\omega\\}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}low-set-subuniform}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in P\\ [f\\prime\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land\\{\\chi_B:B\\in\\mathcal R\\}\\subseteq\\{f_e:e\\in\\omega\\}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个坐标只受对应程序的单值输出约束，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 非空。违反约束由有限停止计算见证，所以它是有效闭类。低基给低矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；每个可计算二值函数的索引对应正确行。若该度 c.e.，high-set-subuniform-ce 会让它同时 high，矛盾。这精确展示 c.e. 假设的作用。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 4.9.6；印刷页 103；PDF 第 139 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-low-basis","status":"resolved","id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-basis","status":"resolved","id":"04a511cfa9ffa494","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P=\\{f\\in2^{\\omega^2}:\\forall e,x,y\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow f(x,e)=\\min(1,y)]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}low-set-subuniform}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in P\\ [f\\prime\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime\\land\\{\\chi_B:B\\in\\mathcal R\\}\\subseteq\\{f_e:e\\in\\omega\\}].","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["04a511cfa9ffa494","b73290a0af01d44f","8756810b413a47d8","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}